{
  "tema": 5088,
  "slug": "era-eras-eramos",
  "titulo": "Ser in the imperfect",
  "subtitulo": "Cuando era niño, era muy tímido.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "Ser is irregular in the imperfect: era, eras, era, éramos, eran. Yo and él/ella share era, and éramos carries an accent.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ser** is one of only **three** irregular verbs in the imperfect (with **ir** and **ver**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "ser"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "era"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "eras"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "era"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "éramos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "eran"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Yo** and **él / ella / usted** share the same form: **era**. Add the subject if it isn't clear."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Éramos** has a **written accent**; the others don't."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use it to describe people, places and things in the past, to say what someone used to be, and to give the time in the past: **Eran las tres.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: no **-aba**, no **-ía**: just **er-** + **a**. Short and sweet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Cuando ==era== niño, ==era== muy tímido.",
              "en": "When I was a kid, I was very shy."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela ==era== maestra en Mexicali.",
              "en": "My grandma was a teacher in Mexicali."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Eran== las seis de la mañana y ya había gente en el agua.",
              "en": "It was six in the morning and there were already people in the water."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Tú ==eras== el más alto de tu salón?",
              "en": "Were you the tallest in your class?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermano y yo ==éramos== inseparables.",
              "en": "My brother and I were inseparable."
            },
            {
              "es": "Esta colonia ==era== muy tranquila antes.",
              "en": "This neighborhood used to be very quiet."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==eran== vecinos, ¿verdad?",
              "en": "You guys used to be neighbors, right?"
            },
            {
              "es": "La casa ==era== vieja, pero el jardín ==era== enorme.",
              "en": "The house was old, but the garden was huge."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
